@GradPath.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Standalone Auth: Register Student
POST {{GradPath.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@gradpath.ai",
  "password": "GradPath2026!",
  "fullName": "Alex Mercer"
}

### 2. Standalone Auth: Login
POST {{GradPath.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@gradpath.ai",
  "password": "GradPath2026!"
}

### 3. Standalone Auth: Current User Me
GET {{GradPath.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me

### 4. Match Engine: Run Scoring Strategy & Eligibility (M2-UC03 & M2-UC04)
POST {{GradPath.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cgpa": 3.65,
  "ieltsScore": 7.5,
  "degree": "Master of Science",
  "targetCountry": "Germany",
  "researchInterests": "Computer Vision, Deep Learning, Edge AI, Autonomous Systems",
  "skills": "Python, PyTorch, C++, ROS, Embedded ML",
  "requiresFunding": true
}

### 5. Approve a Ranked Lead (ApprovedLead v1)
POST {{GradPath.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shortlist/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "studentId": "demo-student-id",
  "studentEmail": "student@gradpath.ai"
}

### 6. View Approved Leads
GET {{GradPath.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/leads/approved
